 'Balances the fresh lime cycle CaCO₃ → CaO + CO₂, CaO + H₂O → Ca(OH)₂ and Ca(OH)₂ + CO₂ → CaCO₃ + H₂O; identifies transport, heat demand and unresolved real quantity/time boundaries.',
